  "h2_input_decision": "H2 primary input model: LightGBM 11-quantile (ST4-08). Chosen to keep the ST3-07 ACI contract unchanged (q0.05/q0.95 base interval, 28-day fixed feedback delay, online update rule, initial state). The 12-fold WQL ranking between A3 and LightGBM is NOT used for this selection: those folds are the preregistered final evaluation set, and selecting on them would couple model selection with H2 evaluation. Disclosure: Stage 3 already produced and reported the LightGBM ACI coverage (0.8885 after calibration), so this decision was not made blind to prior evaluation results. A3-based ACI on the q0.10/q0.90 base interval is theoretically possible but a different experimental setting; deferred to exploratory follow-up. Stage 4 does not re-optimize any interval parameters.",
